{
  "info": {
    "name": "PayNexus - Order Engine Service",
    "description": "Comprehensive API test suite for Order Engine Service (Port 8083).\n\nFolders:\n1. Market Data (Phase 1) - Simulated NSE stock prices and ticker feed\n2. Price Alerts (Phase 2) - Threshold alerts engine, active alert queries, auto-triggers, and cancellations",
